@startuml
title Paper State Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty description
[*] --> Draft : Create Paper (Title + Abstract)
Draft --> HumanReview : Coordinator assigns reviewers & starts round

HumanReview --> ReviewDone : Reviews Submitted (Human Review complete)

ReviewDone --> Completed : Author or Coordinator runs AI Review\n& System verifies Checklist

Completed --> Archived : Coordinator or Author clicks Archive
Archived --> Draft : Reopen (if rejected)
Archived --> Closed : Accepted

Closed --> [*]
@enduml
